Path('RELEASE_NOTES_V2.0.0_RC14.md').write_text('''# ATTEND-PRO 2.0.0-RC14\n\nversionCode 104\n\n- Preserves the field-approved RC12 Bluetooth runtime.\n- Preserves RC13 local-first GPS telemetry and exact distance/accuracy display.\n- Adds a one-time first-run GPS setup dialog on Store: enable GPS presence, choose radius 5-1000m, capture current Store location.\n- Adds a permanent Connection Center action to reopen GPS/radius setup later.\n- GPS remains presence/monitoring only and cannot record attendance by itself.\n''', encoding='utf-8')
Path('FIELD_TEST_CHECKLIST_RC14.md').write_text('''# RC14 field test\n1. Install RC14 over RC12/RC13 without clearing data.\n2. Bluetooth must behave exactly as approved in RC12, including OFF -> ON recovery.\n3. On first Store launch with GPS not configured, confirm the GPS setup dialog appears.\n4. Enable GPS, choose a radius such as 25m, grant location permission if requested, and save.\n5. Confirm Connection Center shows GPS enabled and the chosen radius.\n6. Confirm "إعداد GPS وتحديد النطاق" can reopen setup and change radius later.\n7. Employee phone should show distance in meters + accuracy; Store should receive local GPS over LAN when available and server GPS as fallback.\n8. GPS alone must never create attendance.\n''', encoding='utf-8')

